a well-defined functional on \(\mathrm{CH}^{23}(\mathcal M_{25};\mathbb Q)\), independent of the lift \(\widetilde\alpha\).

Its value on \(\kappa_{23}\) is nonzero:
\[
I_{25}
=\int_{\overline{\mathcal M}_{25}}\kappa_{23}\lambda_{25}\lambda_{24}
=\frac{24!\,|B_{50}|}{2^{25}50!}\ne0.
